- The affiliation details for author Fenglin Dong were incorrectly given as "Department of Ultrasound, The First Affiliated Hospital of Suzhou University, Suzhou, China" but should have been "Department of Ultrasound, The First Affiliated Hospital of Soochow University, Suzhou, China".
